  "title": [
    "[The Graveyard Temporalis]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "In the space between several broken headstones, the ground has been cleared of grass and granite, all marble and vines swept away to make room for a pitched wood fire and a massive cast iron cauldron.  The legs of the cauldron loft the receptacle well above the flames, which are balefire green, and its contents glow with a sickly celadon hue, with gouts of mists creeping over the rim to spill out onto the ground.  Behind it are several vaults arranged in sets."
  ],
